---
description: "Use ast-index for structural code navigation before broad raw text search"
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `.agents/integrations/ast-index.md`. Use `ast-index` first for source-level
code navigation when an index is available: files, symbols, classes, usages,
callers, implementations, outlines, dependencies, and project maps.

Use `rg` for regex, literals, comments, non-code files, or empty ast-index
results. Do not run the upstream Claude plugin installer from this repo.
